 and can also be submitted by email for further analysis. \n\n\"An excellent tool to help you practice to get the perfect lap\" \nwww.TheRCRacer.com", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion": 0, "trackCensoredName": "LapTracker - Auto Timer", "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/kr/app/laptracker-auto-timer/id691114189?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating": "4+", "averageUserRating": 0, "userRatingCount": 0}]}